   },
   "options": {
    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Q:** Are hospitals consuming forecasted stock, and where is unfulfilled demand concentrated?  \n**Action:** Prioritize replenishment for hospitals and medicines exceeding the 2.5% unfulfilled threshold."
   }
  },
