    "mode": "markdown",
    "content": "**Governance & Data Lineage:** Records from 2026-01 onward are synthetic refresh batches made by our oversampling step. Step changes in early 2026 come from that generator, not from business performance.  \n**Metric Contracts (hover `(i)` on panels for details):** **Consumption ratio**: Consumed packs / forecast packs x 100 | Grain: Percent; hospital x medicine x month, summed | Target: >= 95% (assumed) | Exclusions: Rows with null IDs or negative consumption are rejected at staging | **Unfulfilled share of forecast**: Unfulfilled packs / forecast packs x 100 | Grain: Percent; hospital x medicine x month, summed | Target: <= 2.5% (assumed) | Exclusions: Same as above | **Change vs previous refresh**: Value after the latest BI refresh minus value after the refresh before it | Grain: Same unit as the KPI | Target: n/a | Exclusions: First refresh has no previous value"
   }
